Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

1. `tools/source-patch/nested-sessions.patch` is a unified diff against DSH
   source files (`packages/client/ui-workspace/src/...`). The diff text itself is
   authored here, but the context lines it carries quote DSH source code and are
   therefore covered by the DSH MIT license above. The patch is applied by the
   user to a checkout of that project; this repository does not redistribute DSH
   source files or DSH build artifacts.

2. `tools/legacy-dist-patch.mjs` is a structural patcher that rewrites a copy of
   the DSH client bundle *on the user's own machine*. No DSH build output is
   committed to or distributed from this repository.

3. Runtime dependencies are not vendored. The plugin declares
   `@deepseek-ai/*` packages as peer dependencies and resolves them from the
   user's own DSH installation (see `tools/dev-link.mjs` and
   `tools/install.mjs`).

